Nüüdsest maksa kohvi eest nutitelefoniga. Lisa oma pangakaart meie äppi ning:
- Saad 10% kohvikrediiti igalt kohvilt;
- Jälgi kohvikrediidi saldot oma telefonist;
- Saada oma telefonist sõbrale kohv kingituseks (saabub peagi!);
- Leia kiirelt lähim Caffeine’i kohvik;
- Ole kursis värskeimate Caffeine’i uudistega oma telefonis.

Sul pole veel Caffeine’i kohvikaarti? Lisa oma pangakaart äppi ning genereerime sulle automaatselt kliendinumbri.

Kas sul on küsimusi või ettepanekuid? Kirjuta meile app@caffeine.lt

1. Dashboard – Information about your current balance and volume of other bundles on your account, status of your tariff and line;
2. Tariffs – Details of tariffs that fit you the best, compare options, activation/deactivation and other functions in one place;
3. The fast internet and SMS packs – Subscription of packs that fits you the best;
4. Notifications – Get the latest information on various Bakcell services and products to be the first to benefit from discounts and advantageous campaigns;
5. Manage several numbers – Add several mobile numbers to your account, manage and use them with ease;
6. eSIM – Swapping from plastic SIM card to new generation eSIM number;
7. Top-up – Increasing of balance via code or online, credits and money transfers;
8. CINKredit  | KlassKredit – Keep in touch with CINKredit  and KlassKredit services even when not enough funds on mobile balance;
9. Roaming – All tools to stay in touch during your foreign trips;
10. Money transfer – Top-up another CIN or Klass balance by transferring money from your account;
11. Free SMS – Daily 10 off-net and 15 on-net SMS for FREE;
12. Manage profile page – Manage profile of the account with ease on the mobile application;
13. Usage history – Get summary and details of used mobile services;
14. Transaction history – Get summary and details of your spending for mobile services;
15. “Call me” service – Send the request to your friends and ask them to call you, when you don’t have enough funds on mobile balance;
16. Service points – Find the nearest service centers and partners’ addresses by one click;
17. STAR+ – Bonus activity. Use the mobile app and invite your friends to use the app, earn bonuses and redeem them with gifts;
18. Rate and bonus – Rate the Bakcell mobile mobile app and earn bonuses;
19. Live chat – Direct contact with representative of digital channel services of Bakcell.

Notes
- Usage of the “Bakcell” mobile application is free of charge. However, the service fee will be charged from your balance according to your tariff, when you use the app in roaming or follow external links.
- By accepting the Terms and Conditions you are agree with subscriptions’ responsibilities.

